# This file exists mainly so npm does NOT fall back to .gitignore, which ignores `build/` — the
# compiled output that `main` and `types` point at. Never add `build/` here.
#
# The real allowlist is `files` in package.json; these are a belt-and-braces backstop.

# Tarballs generated by `npm pack`
/*.tgz

__mocks__
__tests__

/android/src/androidTest/
/android/src/test/
/android/build/
/android/.gradle/
/android/.cxx/
/ios/build/
/ios/Pods/
